                            "description": "Every step of the campaign's path (Start excluded) in reading order, in PEOPLE since inception, each with the rate to the next. Proactive: Lead found = the leads THIS campaign found = the larger of its sourcing unit's finds (lead-service `leads-found` `found`, per source campaign, never merged with a sibling funnel's source) and the people its outreach unit holds (it held every found lead before 2026-10-12). Then Contacted (`counts.contacted`) and Delivered (`people.delivered`: people an email reached), then each later step = lead-service's `bucket-counts` of its outreach units, merged by max (never a sum). A funnel with no outreach unit (a leads-only funnel: Start -> Lead found -> your team) contacts nobody: Contacted and Delivered are 0, later steps `step_not_counted`. Reactive: the first step = people handed; an act step (Booking call) = people the performing unit acted on (the call placed); every later step = handed people with an attributed outcome at that step."
